  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Community Resilience in Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Improving Community Resilience (ICR) program is a three-year program. The overall objective of the ICR program is to support resilience-building of vulnerable communities, including Albanian women and girls, persons with disabilities, religious and ethnic minorities, Afghan evacuees LGBTQIA+, women and men affected by earthquake etc. The program, through a comprehensive approach, intends to tackle identified drivers of exclusion, marginalization, discrimination, and violence.</narrative>
  </description>
